Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:22.50,WaifuSigns,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fsp-8\bord14\1c&HBB59D5&\3c&HBB59D5&\an8\pos(640,20)}T{\fsp-1}o Become a Place Where Every Form \Nof Life and Sexuality Can Cross Paths
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"to become a place where every form\Nof life and sexuality can cross paths."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is connected with worlds of every dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Women of various races work here as courtesans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll surely be able to find a courtesan \Nof any race you're looking for {You'll surely find the courtesan\Nwith a race you're seeking for}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,that meets your sexual preferences.{to meet your sexual preferences.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You want {\i1}me{\i0}? {You mean me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Us receptionists are trainees \Nwho are yet to become courtesans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not allowed to serve our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:01:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When I become a full-fledged courtesan someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be delighted if you asked for my presence.{I'll be happy if you'll ask for my presence.}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:13.34,0:01:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Courtesans Palace of Mystics!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting, our dear guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mari, one of the unidemon twins.
