Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for requesting our presence tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.26,0:01:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at these!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,See how we only got one pair of horns \Nand wings between the two of us? {right}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, we complete a single demon entity. \NIn other words, we're a Unidemon!{We're a single demon altogether,\Nso we're known as a Unidemon!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us share a single soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Being an exceptional pair with mind \Nand body bound as one is our selling point. {Our selling point is...}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We get along very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right, Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mari...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you saying that right now? It's embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, our dear guest...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to shower you with pleasure!{We'll give you plenty of pleasure!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get a look at it!{May we take a look!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a splendid dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My, oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.73,0:02:57.48,Alternate,,0,0,0,,It's so huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:03:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I see something this amazing...{If I see something this amazing...}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, maybe I should let Yuri have the first squeeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mari...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then... I'll help myself to your splendid dick, {with}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,our dear guest!
