Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm about to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Together! {\alpha&HFF&}Let's do it at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Together! Let's do it at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That felt very good, Young Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!? Are you gonna give me\Na third creampie by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Among all of the previous family heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,nobody has lasted this long! {else}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best patriarch of your lineage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,W-{\alpha&HFF&}Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.97,0:11:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it? Were we able to satisfy yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehh!? Not yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be the first guest of this brothel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,to have such a huge sex drive!{with that much of a sex drive!}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How about picking out another courtesan, then? {up}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening. My name is Ayame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get along well tonight. {for}
