Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Us nine-tailed foxes bring good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We can suck misfortune out of our partners in bed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and give them good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been hunted down since\Nthe old times because of this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a good man, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, I will suck all of your negative energy out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we begin this sexual ritual at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My breast milk has the power to increase good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from that, it boosts energy and revitalizes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,any weakened body parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite beneficial, wouldn't you agree? {Isn't it full of benefits?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must say, when you suck my breast milk like this, {though}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you look just like a huge baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the revitalizing effect is working.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dick is as hard as a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.69,0:12:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,W-{\alpha&HFF&}Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that feels very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's come at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That felt very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:13:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like I can look forward to having sex \Nwith you since your member is like this, eh? {It seems that I can look forward\Nto our sex with your thing like this. }
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then, let's begin! {here}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You might feel some bereavement at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,During that moment, squeeze my hands tightly, okay?{In that case, just grab my hands and hold tight.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, your dick sure is enormous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's poking against my womb!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, your dick...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hitting so hard against a nice spot inside me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming... {\alpha&HFF&}I'm coming already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.59,0:13:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming... I'm coming already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... {\alpha&HFF&}This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.73,0:13:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that was enough to suck out \Na sufficient amount of your bad luck...{I won't be able to suck enough\Nof your bad luck out with this...}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.31,0:14:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-{\alpha&HFF&}What's this, all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's this, all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? {\alpha&HFF&}It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It can't be...{Huh? This can't be...}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I bring him too much good luck\Nthat his sex drive went haywire!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... {\alpha&HFF&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's calm down for a moment, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But if this goes on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be able to suck\Nthe negative energy out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,M-{\alpha&HFF&}Master... I will take it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Master... {\alpha&HFF&}I will take it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Master... I will take it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,so please enjoy me as much as you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that we were able to satisfy you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patronage tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.87,0:14:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Please feel free to pay us another visit!
